          "quote": "出院药单没写、病区没发，就一定不自己恢复吃"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor confirms patient understanding of the plan (do not self-resume doxazosin, track pathology via phone/window, return to ER for red flags), but does not perform a single comprehensive teach-back of all plan elements in the final closure turn. This is a minor omission.",
